  "text": "Surgical Oncology | Pet Tumour Surgery | ONE Pet Cancer Care\nSkip to content\nAbout\nServices\nFor Owners\nFor Vets\nContact us today\nContact us today\nSurgical Oncology\nSurgical Oncology\nSurgical Oncology\nDevAccount\n2026-06-09T01:13:07+10:00\nSurgical Oncology\nThis treatment modality is typically the frontline approach to management of most animal cancers. It can be a minor biopsy procedure to make a histologic diagnosis of a newly discovered lump or bump, or it can be more major involving removal of whole organs or other body parts. The best chance to achieve complete removal of a tumor is at the first surgical intervention and is ideally performed by a surgeon with experience in advanced surgical oncologic techniques.\nConnect with our team\nWhether you’re a pet owner looking for support or a vet referring a patient, here’s how to get started.\nFor pet owners\nCancer treatment information and FAQs\nFor vets\nInformation for referrals and more\nOther Services\nView all services\nPet Cancer Care\nLearn more\nComprehensive Cancer Care\nLearn more\nRadiation Oncology\nLearn more\n1800 111 738\ninfo@onepetcancercare.com\nQuick Links\nAbout\nServices\nFor Owners\nFor Vets\nCase studies\nFAQs\nCareers\nContact\nServices\nPet Cancer Care\nSurgical Oncology\nRadiation Oncology\nMedical Oncology\nLocations\nNorth Shore Vet – Sydney\nConcord – Sydney\nPet Specialists – Sydney\nBVSC – Brisbane\n© All rights reserved. •\nTerms of Use\n•\nPrivacy Policy\n• ONE – Cancer Care for Pets\nPage load link\nWe want you to know that there is\nhope\n.\nAbout\nServices\nFor Owners\nFor Vets\nNorth Shore Veterinary Hospital\n63 Herbert St Artarmon NSW 2064\n02 7252 1411\ninfo@onepetcancercare.com\nBrisbane Veterinary Specialist Centre\n53 Old Northern Rd Albany Creek QLD 4035\n07 3264 9400\ninfo@bvsc.com.au\nThe Pet Specialists\n16 Myoora Rd Terrey Hills NSW 2084\n02 7252 1411 / 1800 111 738\ninfo@onepetcancercare.com\nONE Cancer Care for Pets – Concord\n377 Concord Rd, 